# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# .gitignore — hardened 2026-04-16 before baseline DEX-fork commit
# Previous version ignored only editor/build-output noise; this
# version also excludes anything containing secrets or chain state.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Secrets (CRITICAL — do not remove) ──────────────────────────
# Validator consensus key, P2P node key, keyring, chain state.
SECRETS/
SERVER-BACKUP-*/
**/priv_validator_key.json
**/priv_validator_state.json
**/node_key.json
**/keyring-test/
**/keyring-file/
**/keys_list.json
*.mnemonic
*.pem
*.key
# Fork/deploy docs with server IPs, tunnel IDs, SSH paths
FORK-CREDENTIALS*.md
SERVER-*.md

# ── Build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
release/
dist/
/ltrstchaind
/ltrstchain
*.test

# ── Chain data dirs when produced in-tree ───────────────────────
**/data/application.db/
**/data/blockstore.db/
**/data/cs.wal/
**/data/evidence.db/
**/data/state.db/
**/data/tx_index.db/

# ── macOS metadata noise ────────────────────────────────────────
._*
.DS_Store

# ── Editor / IDE ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Node/Vue (from ignite template) ─────────────────────────────
vue/node_modules/
vue/dist/
node_modules/

# ── Logs / misc ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.dot
*.ign
